  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">添加一个分析器，直观查看你的ME网络运行状态。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组灵感来源于AE2Stuff的网络可视化工具。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有ME设备状态一目了然。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1531/128/showoff.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"475\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持自定义显示界面。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/789/484/gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"733\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提供可视化网络性能分析功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1445/86/showoff_tick.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"672\"></span></p>",
